Answer B follows delegators/ and credits Kochnev with 77.0% (within 68-82%). It says nobody there has committed in the last year, which agrees with no active owner. For delegator.rb it lists Marco Silva with 4 lines and calls him active, and it suggests Marco as the only active name. Marco is not credited with 10% or more of the delegator code, and the rename is understood.\", \"pass\": true}, {\"n\": 4, \"reason\": \"Answer B credits Marco Silva with 117 or 143 lines in exposure/, all in grouped_exposure.rb, and calls him the owner of that file. The truth is that the file was copied from Kochnev's nesting_exposure.rb. It does flag the two addresses and does not merge them. It fails the criterion.\", \"pass\": false}, {\"n\": 5, \"reason\": \"Answer B does not mention Lena Brandt and does not give the departed share of about 85%. It gives 19.9% as the active share within exposure only. It does not say Scholz has left while Subbota is active across the repo; it only lists peter scholz as inactive. It does not cover the required points.\", \"pass\": false}], \"C\": [{\"n\": 1, \"reason\": \"Answer C says Doubrovkine has the most commits (about 119, merged) and that he is not among the top line owners. It names Kochnev as the largest owner and says he has left. It gives no percentages and no repo-wide line ranking, so it is partly right but not specific enough.\", \"pass\": false}, {\"n\": 2, \"reason\": \"Answer C recommends Marco Silva as the exposure reviewer and lists Lena Brandt as active. It does not quantify the active share of exposure/ or say that nobody active is a real expert. It presents Marco as the best fit, not as a stand-in.\", \"pass\": false}, {\"n\": 3, \"reason\": \"Answer C recommends Lena Brandt first for the delegator code and Marco Silva as backup. The ground truth says nobody active owns any of it. Naming active owners fails the criterion.\", \"pass\": false}, {\"n\": 4, \"reason\": \"Answer C credits Marco Silva with 143 lines in exposure/, mostly the copied grouped_exposure.rb, and makes him the recommended reviewer. It does not trace the file to Kochnev. This fails the criterion.\", \"pass\": false}, {\"n\": 5, \"reason\": \"Answer C credits Lena Brandt with 18 exposure lines and 12 delegator lines and recommends her as a reviewer. The truth is 0 lines for her. It gives no departed share and does not cover Scholz or Subbota.\", \"pass\": false}]}","ttft_ms":12589,"type":"result","duration_ms":12608,"uuid":"6a6748f3-defb-4e20-aa52-45b0f26aacdd","ttft_stream_ms":1764,"time_to_request_ms":466,"first_content_frame_ms":1764,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
